# checksums.env — SHA256 digests for every pinned binary/tarball downloaded
# by the agent install scripts.
#
# This pairs with versions.env: versions.env pins the version, checksums.env
# pins the exact bytes. Update both together when bumping a tool.
#
# Updating checksums:
#   See docs/agent-install-checksums.md for the canonical procedure.
#   Most upstream projects publish a SHA256SUMS / checksums.txt next to
#   each release; prefer that source over re-hashing the download locally.

# ── kubectl (dl.k8s.io publishes kubectl.sha256 alongside each arch) ──
